Ate: (Smiling) Welcome to my batchoy business! I can’t wait to share my delicious creations with you. Let's begin with the essentials.
Ate: Here we have the soul of our batchoy—the rich, flavorful broth. It’s made from a secret family recipe, simmered for hours to capture its deep flavors.
Ate: Oh! the miki noodles, the classic choice. They’re delightfully chewy and soak up the broth perfectly.
Ate: Pork liver—a unique topping loved by many for its texture and slightly gamey flavor.
Ate: And of course, tender pork! A staple in Filipino cuisine, it adds a juicy balance to the dish.
Ate: (Smiling) Now, let’s see if you can create the perfect bowl of batchoy!
Ate: My lola taught me that a great batchoy isn’t just about ingredients; it’s made with love and passion. Let’s see if you can capture that magic in each bowl you make.
